1
00:00:00,860 --> 00:00:02,160
喂 伴郎
Hey, best man.

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:03,920
是啊 我也觉得你应该叫我"伴人"
Yeah, I think I might go with "Best person."

3
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:06,260
又是老妈的事吗 我说过了 我没事
Is this about mom again? I told you, I'm fine.

4
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:07,760
我只是有点同情你
I was just a little sad for you.

5
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:08,780
老妈爽约了
Mom's a no-show,

6
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:10,520
你和老爸又几乎不说话
and you and dad are hardly even speaking.

7
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:11,860
我要抛弃你
I'm leaving you!

8
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,820
但我要先抛弃你
Not if I leave you first!

9
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:15,240
你干了什么
What did you do?!

10
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:17,680
注意 各位请注意
Attention! Attention, please!

11
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:19,500
大火已经漫过高速了
The fire has jumped the freeway.

12
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:22,540
等等 等等等等
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

13
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:23,780
如果你们要疏散整个区域
If you're evacuating the whole area,

14
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:25,140
能不能最后疏散我们
can't you just do us last?

15
00:00:25,160 --> 00:00:26,300
恐怕你们还没意识到
I don't think you realize

16
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:28,100
你们离实际火源有多近
how close you are to actual flames.

17
00:00:28,111 --> 00:00:30,740
你好 我是胡娇·萨茨曼
Hello. Pepper Saltzman.

18
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:31,780
你们的忠实粉丝
Big supporter of yours.

19
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:32,780
我收藏了你们所有的年历
Have all your calendars.

20
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:33,920
我们已经等了10年
We've waited 10 years.

21
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:35,360
能给我们一个小时吗
Can we please have an hour?

22
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:36,800
只能给你们30分钟
I can give you 30 minutes.

23
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:38,400
那样就够了
We can make that work!

24
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:41,860
婚礼稍微简化 继续进行
The wedding will go on just in a slightly pared-down version.

25
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:42,760
克莱尔 你到前面去
Claire, you're up front.

26
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:43,869
花童 撒花去
Flower girl, strewing.

27
00:00:43,869 --> 00:00:45,248
新郎们 跟我来
Grooms, come with me.

28
00:00:45,248 --> 00:00:47,280
他们看起来好帅啊
"Ooh! Ahh! They look so handsome!"

29
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,520
四重唱 四重唱 四重唱
Quartet, quartet, quartet!

30
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:51,300
萨尔该你了 五行打油诗就别念了
And cue Sal. Start after your limerick.

31
00:00:51,360 --> 00:00:52,320
天呐 不
Oh, God, no!

32
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:55,000
我们都得牺牲一些 亲爱的
Ugh! We're all making sacrifices, dear.

33
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,020
我那还有一车的帝王蝶
I have a Prius full of monarch butterflies

34
00:00:57,020 --> 00:00:59,020
看来是要跟我回家了
who are apparently coming home with me.

35
00:00:59,085 --> 00:00:59,960
不是吧
Aah! No!

36
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:00,840
她羊水破了
Her water broke!

37
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:03,760
不 没有破 我才刚刚怀孕
No! No, it did not! I am barely pregnant!

38
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:06,580
感谢各位莅临这个大喜的日子
Thank you all for being here on this joyous occasion.

39
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,180
曾有一个基佬名叫塔克
There once was a homo named Tucker --

40
00:01:09,240 --> 00:01:10,940
萨尔 快停下 不行 你要分娩了
Sal, stop. No, you're going into labor!

41
00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:11,940
行行好 快停下吧
Also, just stop!

42
00:01:11,940 --> 00:01:13,980
但我们才在一起四个月啊
But we've only been together four months.

43
00:01:14,140 --> 00:01:15,960
我太爱你了
I just love you so much,

44
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:17,340
迫不及待想要生出你的孩子
I can't wait to have your baby.

45
00:01:18,300 --> 00:01:20,100
天呐 孩子把一切都毁了
God! Kids ruin everything!

46
00:01:20,180 --> 00:01:20,740
是啊 没错
Yeah, they sure do.

47
00:01:20,740 --> 00:01:22,880
我带你去医院 生下我们的奇迹宝宝吧
Let's get you to the hospital and have our miracle baby.

48
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:23,440
好
Okay.

49
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:24,940
只是要告知你一下
Just so you know,

50
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,700
有时这么早产的孩子
sometimes when babies come this early...

51
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:28,080
生出来是黑皮肤的
...they're black.

52
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:29,820
彻底灾难了
Okay, this is a disaster!

53
00:01:29,820 --> 00:01:31,240
没人为我们证婚了
We have no one to marry us!

54
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:34,040
亲爱的人们 这确实是个问题
Dearly beloved, that is a problem.

55
00:01:34,620 --> 00:01:35,060
是啊
Yep.

56
00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:37,700
感谢35美元和互联网
Thanks to $35 and the internet,

57
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:38,620
您现在看到的是
you are looking at

58
00:01:38,620 --> 00:01:40,826
好牧师菲利普·汉弗莱·邓菲
the good reverend Phillip Humphrey Dunphy.

59
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:43,820
去年一整年 我都在向米奇和小卡暗示
Over the last year, I've dropped a few subtle hints

60
00:01:43,820 --> 00:01:45,440
我也可以当婚礼主持
to Mitch and Cam that I was available.

61
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:48,040
你们决定让谁做主婚人了吗
Hey, have you guys decided who's gonna officiate your wedding?

62
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,480
我在网上获得牧师资格了
'cause I got ordained online.

63
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:50,240
天呐 那儿有小袋鼠
Oh, my God. A wallaby!

64
00:01:50,340 --> 00:01:50,860
天呐
Oh, my gosh!

65
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:54,040
未完待续
To be continued!

66
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:57,180
菲尔 你真是大救星 谢谢你
Phil, you're a lifesaver. Thank you.

67
00:01:57,320 --> 00:01:58,150
不必感谢
No thanks necessary.

68
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:00,160
卡梅隆 为你证婚[娶你]
Cameron, marrying you would

69
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:01,740
让我成了世上最幸福的男人
make me the happiest man on earth.

70
00:02:03,380 --> 00:02:04,920
各位 请注意
Everyone, attention, please!

71
00:02:05,180 --> 00:02:07,500
消防队长刚通知我
I've been informed by the fire chief

72
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:09,320
我们得马上撤离
we need to leave immediately!

73
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:10,960
-风向变了 -什么
- The winds have shifted! - What?

74
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:12,600
但我们有30分钟的啊
But w-we have 30 minutes!

75
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:15,040
一个婚庆策划同事通知我
A fellow wedding facilitator has informed me

76
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:17,720
有个美丽的场地刚刚空出来了
a beautiful space just became available.

77
00:02:17,720 --> 00:02:18,580
大家都去摆渡车那里
To the shuttles!

78
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:20,580
但我们完全不了解那地方的情况
But we don't know a thing about this place.

79
00:02:20,740 --> 00:02:22,320
我的错
Oh, my mistake.

80
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:23,720
我们快速了解一下
Let's go over it.

81
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:25,140
那是个古雅充满田园风情的地方
It's a quaint, rustic spot,

82
00:02:25,140 --> 00:02:26,440
但其主要卖点是
though its chief selling point

83
00:02:26,440 --> 00:02:29,600
那里不会变成烧窖
is it's not about to become a kiln!

84
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:31,220
大家都去摆渡车那里
To the shuttles!

85
00:02:43,860 --> 00:02:45,260
小卡 把大家从停车场
Cam, where are the shuttles

86
00:02:45,260 --> 00:02:46,740
载到山上的摆渡车都哪儿去了
that brought everyone up from the parking lot?

87
00:02:46,740 --> 00:02:47,680
显然是有别人也订了
Apparently they were double booked.

88
00:02:47,760 --> 00:02:49,060
胡娇已经尽力了
This is the best Pepper could do.

89
00:02:49,380 --> 00:02:51,200
我们就让大家这样去婚礼会场吗
This is how we're getting everyone to the wedding?

90
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:52,300
我们有一半的来宾是基佬
Half our guests are gay.

91
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,180
他们终于可以有一次
We're finally giving them

92
00:02:53,180 --> 00:02:54,520
不受欺负的校车回忆了
a good memory on a school bus.

93
00:02:54,740 --> 00:02:56,340
那边没有完全缝好
That doesn't look completely sewn on.

94
00:02:56,340 --> 00:02:57,560
你最好找个东西遮一下
You might want to get something to cover that.

95
00:02:57,740 --> 00:02:58,480
好主意
Oh, good idea.

96
00:02:59,000 --> 00:02:59,700
谢谢
Thank you.

97
00:03:00,140 --> 00:03:03,320
你跟莫尔说了什么让他想抛弃巴布
What did you say to Merle that make him want to leave Barb?

98
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:04,260
我不知道啊
I have no idea!

99
00:03:04,260 --> 00:03:05,703
我们闲聊而已
We were just shooting the breeze --

100
00:03:05,703 --> 00:03:06,900
聊婚礼 迪迪
Wedding day, DeDe,

101
00:03:06,900 --> 00:03:08,540
还有娶了你我有多幸福
how happy I am now that I'm with you.

102
00:03:08,620 --> 00:03:10,440
你为什么要说那些
Why would you say something like that?

103
00:03:10,540 --> 00:03:12,400
你这样可伤透了某人的心
Now you're breaking somebody's heart.

104
00:03:12,460 --> 00:03:14,020
我没想伤害巴布
I didn't mean for her to get hurt.

105
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:16,080
不是巴布 是莫尔 当他意识到
Not her, him when he realizes

106
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:19,040
不是每个人的第二任妻子都能有这种身材
that not every second wife looks like this.

107
00:03:19,096 --> 00:03:21,880
谢谢你把外套借给我 杰
Thank you for lending me your jacket, Jay.

108
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:24,900
知道这世上还有绅士 我很欣慰
It's good to know there are still gentlemen in the world.

109
00:03:24,900 --> 00:03:26,180
是你啊 巴布
Oh, it's you, Barb.

110
00:03:26,180 --> 00:03:27,700
我的美好未来在前方闪耀
I didn't see you there on account of

111
00:03:27,710 --> 00:03:28,946
我都没注意到你
my bright future.

112
00:03:30,202 --> 00:03:31,420
谢谢你 歌洛莉亚
Thank you, Gloria.

113
00:03:31,420 --> 00:03:33,180
勇敢抵抗那个老混蛋[山羊]
Standing up to that old goat

114
00:03:33,180 --> 00:03:34,700
是我做过最棒的事
was best thing I ever did.

115
00:03:35,580 --> 00:03:36,620
那是怎么回事
What's all that about?

116
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:40,120
不不 是她跟我讲的一个山羊的故事
No, no. The thing is that she told me a story about a goat

117
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:42,400
山羊很老了 后来这只山羊
and it's very old and then the goat --

118
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:42,960
别糊弄我
Oh, don't give me that.

119
00:03:43,460 --> 00:03:46,020
我让她勇敢表达自己
I told her to express herself.

120
00:03:46,031 --> 00:03:47,369
我相信一段和谐的婚姻中
I believe that in a good marriage,

121
00:03:47,369 --> 00:03:47,900
女人能够表...
a woman can ex--

122
00:03:47,900 --> 00:03:49,880
好吧 无所谓 我来解决
Fine. Whatever. I'll undo it.

123
00:03:51,100 --> 00:03:54,960
我们不能让小卡知道他父母的情况
We can't let Cam know what the situation with his parents is.

124
00:03:55,040 --> 00:03:56,400
他非常敏感的
He's very delicate.

125
00:03:57,340 --> 00:03:59,160
难以相信 我竟然
I can't believe I'm involved

126
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:01,000
又一次参与了破坏他人婚姻的事
in breaking up yet another marriage.

127
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:01,883
什么
What?

128
00:04:03,460 --> 00:04:05,020
你还好吗
Hey, hey. How you holding up?

129
00:04:05,020 --> 00:04:06,349
不是很好
Uh, I've had better days.

130
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:08,060
但你跟我 我们没事吧
But you and me -- we're cool, right?

131
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:10,040
有些事情我们可能需要谈一谈
We probably have some things that we should talk about,

132
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:11,560
但是留在压力没这么大的日子谈吧
but maybe we save it for a less-stressful day.

133
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:13,220
顺便说一句 这不是你的错
This is not your fault, by the way.

134
00:04:13,298 --> 00:04:14,840
火是不可抗力
the fire was an act of God.

135
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:16,900
不是说上帝搞了个火球
Not that God sent a fireball down

136
00:04:16,900 --> 00:04:18,521
不让男人和男人结婚 但是...
to keep a couple guys from getting married, but, uh...

137
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:20,100
我表达得不太好
I didn't say that right.

138
00:04:20,100 --> 00:04:22,220
今天所有的一切都绝不可能
There's no way that this -- any of this --

139
00:04:22,220 --> 00:04:23,360
是上帝的安排
is part of God's plan.

140
00:04:24,100 --> 00:04:25,500
留到敬酒时再说吧 老爸
Save something for the toast, dad.

141
00:04:25,637 --> 00:04:26,636
该死
Damn it.

142
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:29,080
你想把这个放在哪里
Where do you want this?

143
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:31,120
五号巴士 你的声音怎么了
Bus five. What's wrong with your voice?

144
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,580
我们三个自驾游去了
The three of us just took a road trip.

145
00:04:32,860 --> 00:04:33,980
去德州边境的路上
We sang Broadway tunes

146
00:04:33,980 --> 00:04:35,400
我们一直在唱百老汇的歌
all the way to the Texas border.

147
00:04:35,580 --> 00:04:37,580
从德州另一面去佛罗里达的路上也是
And then from the other side of Texas to Florida.

148
00:04:40,300 --> 00:04:41,840
所以你是牧师吗
Hey, so you're, like, the minister?

149
00:04:42,100 --> 00:04:43,480
差不多吧 萨尔走后
Kinda. When they lost Sal,

150
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:44,841
事情变得不费脑筋[没脑子]
the situation was a no-brainer,

151
00:04:44,841 --> 00:04:46,020
所以他们想到了我
which made them think of me.

152
00:04:46,020 --> 00:04:48,240
要证婚不是要记住很多东西吗
Isn't there a lot you have to remember to marry people?

153
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:50,420
没有啦 都是一样的词儿
Not really. They all follow the same basic pattern.

154
00:04:50,640 --> 00:04:52,160
我们今天齐聚一堂 参加两位新人的
"We're gathered here today to join these two

155
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:53,000
神圣婚礼
"in holy matrimony.

156
00:04:53,060 --> 00:04:55,020
你愿意让他做你的合法配偶吗
Do you take him to be your lawfully wedded spouse?"

157
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:56,300
第一个人说
And the first person says --

158
00:04:56,300 --> 00:04:57,180
-我愿意 -对
- I do? - Right.

159
00:04:57,340 --> 00:04:58,600
然后我问第二个人
Then I ask the second person,

160
00:04:58,680 --> 00:05:00,300
你愿意让他做你的合法配偶吗
"Do you take him to be your lawfully wedded spouse?"

161
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,460
-你们知道这一套吧 -对[我愿意]
- You know the drill, right? - I do.

162
00:05:01,640 --> 00:05:03,020
然后我说 根据加利福利亚州
Then I say, "By the powers vested in me

163
00:05:03,020 --> 00:05:03,900
赋予我的权力
by the state of California,

164
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:05,020
我宣布你们结为合法配偶
I now pronounce you legally wed."

165
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,300
噼里啪啦砰 这婚就结成了
Bingo, bango, bongo, you're married.

166
00:05:06,660 --> 00:05:07,020
太棒了
Awesome.

167
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:09,400
真的很棒
Really awesome.

168
00:05:15,260 --> 00:05:17,460
巴布 我理解你现在的经历
Look, Barb, I know what you're going through.

169
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:20,980
你和莫尔的婚姻走到了十字路口
You and Merle are at a crossroads in your marriage.

170
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:22,740
感觉像是世界末日
It feels like the end of the world,

171
00:05:22,740 --> 00:05:25,080
但是不久后 你会觉得这是...
but in time, you'll see it more as a --

172
00:05:25,422 --> 00:05:26,140
对啊
Right.

173
00:05:26,140 --> 00:05:28,040
就像打嗝一样的小插曲 谁都会经历
A little hiccup that we all go through.

174
00:05:28,820 --> 00:05:30,680
我的建议是 什么都别做
My advice -- don't do anything.

175
00:05:31,300 --> 00:05:33,980
花点时间 喘口气
Just take some time and breathe.

176
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,440
从鼻子里呼气比较好
Maybe through your nose.

177
00:05:36,820 --> 00:05:39,220
你在我的口袋里找到了什么吗
Did you happen to find anything in one of my pockets?

178
00:05:40,140 --> 00:05:41,420
你这样问真奇怪[酒瓶]
Funny you should "Flask."

179
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:45,380
这个给我吧
Maybe I'll just take that.

180
00:05:46,530 --> 00:05:47,361
不好意思
Excuse me.

181
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:49,680
现在轻多了 对吧
Well, it's much lighter now, isn't it?

182
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:50,442
是啊
Yeah.

183
00:05:50,620 --> 00:05:51,600
真奇怪
Okay, this is weird.

184
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,960
我觉得这就是我去学校路上时
I think this is the same seat I used to nervously scratch at

185
00:05:54,100 --> 00:05:54,760
紧张抓挠的座椅
on my way to school.

186
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:56,160
真可怜
Oh, poor thing.

187
00:05:56,500 --> 00:05:56,900
是啊
Yeah.

188
00:05:57,081 --> 00:05:59,080
我那时就觉得要做到完美好有压力
Even then I felt such pressure to be perfect.

189
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:00,840
安迪的航班又延误了
Andy's flight is delayed again.

190
00:06:01,280 --> 00:06:02,240
好吧 很接近了
Okay. That was close.

191
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,520
我们差点就在人类水平上有交流了
We almost connected on a human level.

192
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:04,780
他在做蠢事
He's doing the dumbest thing.

193
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:05,980
他女朋友和他分手了
His girlfriend broke up with him,

194
00:06:05,980 --> 00:06:07,820
他要飞过去赢回她的心
and he's flying out to win her back.

195
00:06:07,820 --> 00:06:09,380
听起来好浪漫
That sounds so romantic.

196
00:06:09,380 --> 00:06:10,580
太软弱了
It's so weak.

197
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:12,880
这女生一发脾气 他就跑过去
This girl throws a fit, he goes running.

198
00:06:12,940 --> 00:06:15,840
如果他们复合了 她就大权在握了
If they get back together, she has all the power.

199
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:19,060
天啊 你喜欢他
Oh, my god. You like him.

200
00:06:19,200 --> 00:06:20,400
不 我才没有 什么啊
No, I don't. What?

201
00:06:20,420 --> 00:06:21,320
太搞笑了
This is so hilarious.

202
00:06:21,440 --> 00:06:22,540
他完全不是你喜欢的类型
He's totally not your type.

203
00:06:22,580 --> 00:06:23,400
闭嘴
Shut up.

204
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:26,340
拜托 你一直想着他 查看他的情况
Please. You can't stop thinking about him, you're checking on him.

205
00:06:26,460 --> 00:06:27,980
他甚至不像个真人
He's not even like a real person.

206
00:06:28,020 --> 00:06:28,900
他就像个提线木偶
He's like a muppet.

207
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:33,060
我都不明白萨尔写的一些话
I don't even get some of Sal's remarks here.

208
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:34,420
婚姻就像是高速公路
"Marriage is like a freeway --

209
00:06:34,620 --> 00:06:36,640
很凌乱 但如果你们交流 就很值得
Messy, but if you communicate, it's so worth it."

210
00:06:36,640 --> 00:06:38,760
亲 那不是"高速公路"[threeway: 三人式]
Honey, that does not say "Freeway."

211
00:06:40,440 --> 00:06:41,680
我不能用这个
I can't use any of this,

212
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,540
但我不想让这场婚礼很普通
but I don't want the whole ceremony to be generic.

213
00:06:43,540 --> 00:06:45,405
应该要有些魔力
There needs to be some magic in it.

214
00:06:45,405 --> 00:06:46,430
你可以读一首诗或者
Well, you can read a poem or maybe --

215
00:06:46,440 --> 00:06:47,320
等等 往回倒
Hold on. Back up.

216
00:06:47,320 --> 00:06:48,923
我喜欢你的上一个主意 变魔术
I like your last idea -- a magic trick.

217
00:06:48,923 --> 00:06:49,820
我没有提议要变魔术
I did not suggest a magic trick.

218
00:06:49,820 --> 00:06:51,060
毕竟 有什么比魔术
After all, what's better than magic

219
00:06:51,060 --> 00:06:52,720
更能象征婚姻的美好呢
to symbolize the wonder of marriage?!

220
00:06:54,280 --> 00:06:56,060
抱歉 我在和你说话呢
Excuse me. I'm talking to you.

221
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:56,960
好吧
Yeah, yeah.

222
00:06:56,960 --> 00:06:58,340
在商店里你穿起来还不错
They looked good on you in the store,

223
00:06:58,340 --> 00:06:59,320
但现在你不确定了
but now you're not sure.

224
00:06:59,320 --> 00:07:01,316
那是十分钟前的话题
That was the topic 10 minutes ago.

225
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:03,240
也许我把体育版贴到我头上
Well, maybe if I stapled the sports page to my head,

226
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:03,960
你就会注意到我了
you'd pay attention.

227
00:07:04,060 --> 00:07:05,540
只要能盖住你的嘴
As long as it covered your mouth.

228
00:07:05,740 --> 00:07:06,920
-什么 -没事
- What? - Nothing.

229
00:07:09,379 --> 00:07:11,869
我们什么时候才能到啊
Ugh, when are we going to be there?

230
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:13,460
快了 亲爱的 很快了
Soon, honey. Very soon.

231
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:15,080
来 笑一个
Come on. Give us a smile.

232
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:17,260
记住 这是你爸爸们生命中
Remember, this is the happiest day

233
00:07:17,260 --> 00:07:18,858
最快乐的一天
of your dads' lives.

234
00:07:19,700 --> 00:07:21,100
蝴蝶在吃我
The butterflies are eating me!

235
00:07:21,100 --> 00:07:23,330
谁要你碰那个盒子的
Well, who told you to jostle the crate?!

236
00:07:23,330 --> 00:07:24,960
一只飞进了我嘴里
Oh, blah. One got in my mouth.

237
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:26,420
真是一群小孩
What a bunch of babies.

238
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:34,620
胡娇说这里很棒 希望我们会喜欢
Pepper said it was nice. I hope we like it.

239
00:07:34,620 --> 00:07:37,080
小卡 不管帘子那边是什么样
Cam, Cam, listen, whatever's on the other side of this curtain,

240
00:07:37,080 --> 00:07:38,220
我们都不能失望
we cannot be disappointed.

241
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:38,780
你说得对
You're right.

242
00:07:38,820 --> 00:07:41,380
今天的重点不是花朵或其他肤浅的事
Today is not about flowers or superficial things.

243
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:42,800
对 好吧
Right. Okay.

244
00:07:42,974 --> 00:07:45,087
-谢天谢地 -好漂亮 我害怕死了
- Oh, thank god. - It's pretty. I was so scared!

245
00:07:45,087 --> 00:07:46,840
我超喜欢 我都要哭了
Oh, I love it, I love it. I could cry!

246
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:48,360
别哭了 会把脸上打的修容粉毁掉的
Oh, don't cry. You'll streak your bronzer.

247
00:07:48,700 --> 00:07:50,260
大家请就坐
Everyone, please take your seats!

248
00:07:50,260 --> 00:07:52,310
我们五分钟[西语]后开始
We'll be starting in cinco minutes,

249
00:07:52,310 --> 00:07:53,650
也就是最多十分钟
10 at the most.

250
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:54,780
你有没有发现罗纳多的
Do you ever notice with Ronaldo

251
00:07:54,780 --> 00:07:55,880
语言障碍时不时会发作是吗
how his language barrier sort of fluctuates?

252
00:07:55,880 --> 00:07:57,460
这地方是怎么订到的
How is this place even available?

253
00:07:57,760 --> 00:07:58,960
可怕的故事
Oh, dreadful story.

254
00:07:59,140 --> 00:08:02,360
新娘跑了 新郎闹自杀 世仇家族
Runaway bride, suicidal groom, feuding families.

255
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:04,860
相比之下我们的小问题真是不值一提
It really puts our mundane problems in perspective.

256
00:08:04,860 --> 00:08:06,340
灯光不能调暗
Oh, we can't dim the lights.

257
00:08:06,340 --> 00:08:07,040
那就打碎几盏
Then break some.

258
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,500
他们已没有年轻人那么无敌的皮肤了
These are not young men!

259
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:11,040
你们去梳洗打扮一下吧
Why don't you two go freshen up?

260
00:08:12,380 --> 00:08:12,780
等等
Wait.

261
00:08:13,080 --> 00:08:14,800
为什么四重奏只来了一半
Why am I seeing only half a quartet?

262
00:08:14,880 --> 00:08:16,260
埃德和吉姆是志愿消防员
Ed and jim are volunteer firemen.

263
00:08:16,460 --> 00:08:17,300
可不是嘛
Of course they are.

264
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:19,020
你们尽量找面镜子对着弹吧
Try to play in front of a mirror.

265
00:08:21,238 --> 00:08:22,580
-幸运之吻 - 好吧 好吧
- A kiss for luck. - Oh, okay. Yes.

266
00:08:22,580 --> 00:08:24,840
给我个幸运吻 我的小姜饼
A kiss for luck, my little gingersnap!

267
00:08:24,840 --> 00:08:27,000
好吧 巴布
Oh, okay. Oh, wow, barb.

268
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:28,860
幸好我们已经出了火灾区
Oh, oh, good thing we're out of the fire zone.

269
00:08:28,860 --> 00:08:32,560
要知道你爸爸给了我个婚礼小帮手
Well, you know your dad gave me a little wedding helper.

270
00:08:32,560 --> 00:08:34,480
我不知道我外套里面还有一个
I didn't know the jacket still had a --

271
00:08:34,480 --> 00:08:35,920
酒瓶 是啊 真好
Flask. Yeah. Oh, that's nice.

272
00:08:36,420 --> 00:08:37,340
你知道 在仪式结束时
You know, at the end of the ceremony,

273
00:08:37,380 --> 00:08:38,120
我要亲一个男人
I kiss a man,

274
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:40,046
所以你把酒瓶装满做好准备吧
so you might want to fill 'er up.

275
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:42,340
你就这么解决问题吗
This is how you try to fix things?

276
00:08:42,560 --> 00:08:44,980
-把她灌醉 -别怪他
- You get her drunk? - Don't blame him.

277
00:08:45,060 --> 00:08:46,180
自从她去了那个
She's been a loose cannon

278
00:08:46,180 --> 00:08:47,340
十点半开始祈祷仪式的教堂
ever since she started going

279
00:08:47,340 --> 00:08:49,820
她就变成了一个定时炸弹
to that church service that starts at 10:30.

280
00:08:49,820 --> 00:08:51,340
他们还弹吉他呢
They play guitar music.

281
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:52,720
那是个庆祝活动
It's a celebration.

282
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:54,444
那是个罪恶之城
It's gomorrah.

283
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:57,520
牧师还戴着麦当娜唱歌用的麦克风呢
The pastor wears one of them madonna microphones.

284
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:58,028
什么麦当娜唱歌用的麦克风
Oh, madonna microphones.

285
00:08:58,996 --> 00:09:01,157
我的小玉米须哪里去了
Where's my little corn silk?

286
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:03,880
这事结束之后你想去做点儿有意思的事吗
Hey, you want to go out and do something fun after this thing?

287
00:09:03,880 --> 00:09:05,380
不 我想今晚在家呆着
No, I was thinking about staying in tonight

288
00:09:05,380 --> 00:09:06,460
好好陪陪乔
and spending some time with joe.

289
00:09:06,680 --> 00:09:07,980
自从有了那孩子
Ugh, you never want to do anything

290
00:09:07,980 --> 00:09:09,500
你就什么都不想做了
since that baby came along.

291
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:11,940
-你怎么样 -我很好
- How are you? - I'm good.

292
00:09:11,940 --> 00:09:13,120
你带了 那个
You -- you have the, um --

293
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:15,300
结婚证 戒指 签字笔 祝酒词吗
Marriage license, rings, signing pen, toast?

294
00:09:15,300 --> 00:09:15,960
是的 当然都带了
Yes, of course.

295
00:09:15,970 --> 00:09:17,606
不然怎么会叫我伴人[最棒的人]呢
There's a reason I'm the best person.

296
00:09:17,606 --> 00:09:19,360
这只是在今天才有的称呼而已
You know that's just a title for today, right?

297
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:21,281
是的 我是这个婚礼上最棒的人
Yeah, I'm the best person at this wedding.

298
00:09:21,803 --> 00:09:23,360
我还是会听到... 那是什么
I'm still kind of hearing -- what is that?

299
00:09:23,380 --> 00:09:24,640
我的天 我的上帝
Oh, my god. Oh, my god.

300
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:25,860
慢着
Wait. Oh.

301
00:09:26,860 --> 00:09:28,480
沾上花粉了 不是吧
That's pollen. Oh, no.

302
00:09:28,580 --> 00:09:29,740
-亲爱的 -别看我
- Honey. - Don't look at me.

303
00:09:29,740 --> 00:09:30,880
我只有那一个胸花
I only had one corsage.

304
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:31,660
你姐姐哪去了
Where's your sister?

305
00:09:35,500 --> 00:09:36,060
海莉
Haley?

306
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:38,560
安迪 你还在这里呢
Andy! You're still here?

307
00:09:38,880 --> 00:09:39,320
是啊
Yeah.

308
00:09:39,660 --> 00:09:41,760
因为天气原因我的航班一直被推迟
My flight keeps getting delayed because of weather.

309
00:09:42,260 --> 00:09:43,120
我们的婚礼也是
Oh, so does the wedding.

310
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:44,840
等等 火灾算天气原因吗
Wait. Is fire weather?

311
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:46,760
-着火了吗 -是的
- There was a fire? - Yeah.

312
00:09:47,220 --> 00:09:49,220
怪不得你的裙子热辣得冒烟
Guess that explains that smoking dress.

313
00:09:51,040 --> 00:09:52,480
注意分寸 安迪
Line, Andy.

314
00:09:53,099 --> 00:09:55,600
那个 如果你想打发时间
Well, if you're -- if you're just killing time,

315
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:56,820
新的婚宴场地就在附近
the new wedding venue is nearby.

316
00:09:56,860 --> 00:09:57,960
你完全可以过来转转
You could totally come and hang.

317
00:09:57,960 --> 00:10:00,140
我觉得我的穿着不太合适
I don't think I'm exactly dressed for it.

318
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:01,940
当然如果我跟你在一起
Of course, if I was with you,

319
00:10:01,940 --> 00:10:03,480
没有人会去看我的
no one would even look at me.

320
00:10:03,740 --> 00:10:05,060
好了
Wow, okay.

321
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:07,600
你馅饼吃得够多了 年轻人
That is quite enough pie for you, young man.

322
00:10:10,034 --> 00:10:12,098
我得回去了
Ugh. I've got to get back.

323
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:16,411
那个 我来这里不是为了喝咖啡的
Um, look, I didn't come here for coffee.

324
00:10:17,140 --> 00:10:18,700
安迪 我觉得你不应该
Andy, I don't think it's a good idea

325
00:10:18,700 --> 00:10:19,700
上这班飞机
for you to get on that plane.

326
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:21,140
我不觉得贝丝值得你这样付出
I don't think Beth is worth it.

327
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:22,460
你根本不了解贝丝
You don't even know Beth.

328
00:10:22,660 --> 00:10:23,620
我想我了解
I think I do.

329
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:25,900
我想我之前和她一样
I think I've been her.

330
00:10:26,540 --> 00:10:27,420
让我猜猜
Let me guess.

331
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:29,480
你写十封信她只回一封
For every 10 letters you write, she writes one.

332
00:10:29,900 --> 00:10:32,260
她永远是先挂断电话的那个人
She's always the one who ends the phone call.

333
00:10:32,260 --> 00:10:35,460
你不经意间提起你自己的生日
You happen to mention when your birthday's coming up

334
00:10:35,460 --> 00:10:40,080
因为你心里知道她早已经忘了
because you know deep down she's already forgotten it.

335
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:43,280
与此同时 她给你的刚好够拴住你的心
Meanwhile, she gives you just enough to keep you on the hook.

336
00:10:47,620 --> 00:10:48,100
喂
Hello?

337
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:51,240
我当然没走 妈妈
Of course I didn't leave, mom.

338
00:10:51,260 --> 00:10:53,420
几秒钟前你才从我身边路过
You walked past me two seconds ago.

339
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:57,240
我想说的是 你值得拥有更好的
I'm just saying, you deserve better.

340
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,540
我的天啊
Oh, my god!

341
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:01,120
我正跟你招手呢
I'm waving at you!

342
00:11:01,260 --> 00:11:02,040
站着别动
Stay where you are!

343
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:03,360
我正在朝你走
I'm walking towards you!

344
00:11:04,065 --> 00:11:05,860
莉莉 来 我需要你的胸花
Lily, here you go. I'm taking your corsage.

345
00:11:05,860 --> 00:11:06,820
可那是我的
But it's mine.

346
00:11:06,920 --> 00:11:07,740
你是花童
You're the flower girl.

347
00:11:07,820 --> 00:11:08,380
给别人花是你的工作
It's part of your job.

348
00:11:08,380 --> 00:11:09,660
好好读读你的合同 谢谢
Read the fine print. Thank you.

349
00:11:09,660 --> 00:11:10,540
-克莱尔 -怎么了
- Claire! - What?

350
00:11:10,540 --> 00:11:12,003
我需要戒指
I-I need the rings.

351
00:11:12,052 --> 00:11:13,600
-干什么 -排练我们的魔术
- For what? - To practice our trick.

352
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:14,220
拜托拜托 快来
Come on, come on, come on.

353
00:11:14,260 --> 00:11:16,280
亲爱的 我不确定该不该变魔术
Oh, honey, I don't know about the magic trick.

354
00:11:16,340 --> 00:11:17,300
你不觉得大家应该把注意力
Don't you think people should be

355
00:11:17,300 --> 00:11:18,640
集中在小卡和米奇身上吗
focused on Cam and Mitch?

356
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:20,680
我正希望是 他们是完美的掩饰
I'm hoping so. It's the perfect misdirect.

357
00:11:20,900 --> 00:11:22,060
好了 我们来这么做
Okay, here's how we're gonna do this.

358
00:11:22,143 --> 00:11:23,520
-你拿着戒指 -好吧
- You hold the rings. - Okay.

359
00:11:23,520 --> 00:11:25,920
我说 "人们说最好的婚姻
I say, "They say the best marriages

360
00:11:25,920 --> 00:11:28,400
拥有一点点魔力"
contain just a little bit of magic."

361
00:11:29,160 --> 00:11:29,980
我们举起手臂
We hold up our arms.

362
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:31,060
你放开戒指
You let go of the rings.

363
00:11:31,160 --> 00:11:32,460
戒指顺着线滑下来
They slide down the thread

364
00:11:32,460 --> 00:11:34,140
仿佛神奇地飘过来一样
as if mysteriously floating

365
00:11:34,140 --> 00:11:36,640
一路滑到 中间位置
all the way -- half the way to me.

366
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:42,080
莫尔 我知道你和杰谈过之后
Merle, I know that after talking to Jay,

367
00:11:42,100 --> 00:11:44,560
你觉得你能找到更好的
you think that there are better things out there for you.

368
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,100
谁说不会呢
Who says there isn't?

369
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:46,760
好吧
Okay.

370
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:48,600
我们来看看未来是什么样子
Take a trip with me to the future.

371
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:51,820
当地廉价酒吧里的一个普通夜晚
It's a regular night at the local honky tonk.

372
00:11:51,820 --> 00:11:54,320
看哪 是谁独自一人坐在吧台
Look, who's that man sitting alone in the bar?

373
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:55,800
是莫尔
It's Merle.

374
00:11:56,180 --> 00:11:57,880
一个美女款款走来
A beautiful woman approaches.

375
00:11:58,280 --> 00:12:00,180
她问 "你旁边有人坐吗"
She asks, "Is this seat taken?"

376
00:12:00,420 --> 00:12:04,220
他说"没有" 然后她拿过椅子
He says, "No," and then she grabs the chair

377
00:12:04,220 --> 00:12:06,509
走去坐在一个更年轻
and goes sits next to a much younger,

378
00:12:06,580 --> 00:12:08,680
更帅气的男人身边
much handsomer-looking man.

379
00:12:09,130 --> 00:12:11,066
莫尔转头对酒保说
Then Merle turns around to the bartender

380
00:12:11,066 --> 00:12:13,550
"星期二快乐 是吧"
And say, "Happy Tuesday, huh?"

381
00:12:13,560 --> 00:12:15,280
酒保回答说
The bartender replies,

382
00:12:16,080 --> 00:12:18,420
你想说的是"圣诞快乐"吧
"Don't you mean 'Merry Christmas'?"

383
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:20,180
看到了吧 莫尔
You see, Merle?

384
00:12:20,660 --> 00:12:22,760
你圣诞节孤零零一人在喝酒
It was Christmas the whole time!

385
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:25,760
可以开始了 乐队奏乐
Okay, it's show time. Cue the processional.

386
00:12:25,760 --> 00:12:28,200
菲尔 用我老家南卡罗来那州的话说
Phil, as they say in my native South Carolina,

387
00:12:28,380 --> 00:12:30,080
该给你弟的男人证婚了[娶他]
it's time to marry your brother-in-law.

388
00:12:31,292 --> 00:12:33,337
小花童 撒花瓣吧
Flower girl, work those petals.

389
00:12:33,980 --> 00:12:35,020
新人入场
Wedding party walking.

390
00:12:35,880 --> 00:12:36,340
什么事
What's that?

391
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:37,920
我马上过去
I'll be right there.

392
00:12:39,420 --> 00:12:41,380
好了 最后检查一下
Okay. Last looks.

393
00:12:42,940 --> 00:12:43,620
你超帅的
Very handsome.

394
00:12:44,740 --> 00:12:46,640
这是你的正装里我第二喜欢的
This is my second favorite suit of yours.

395
00:12:46,720 --> 00:12:47,280
第二喜欢
Second?

396
00:12:47,280 --> 00:12:48,700
我最喜欢你生日穿的那套
Right after your birthday suit.

397
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:51,820
别说了 人家都是已婚男人了
Hey. Cut it out. I'm practically a married man.

398
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:52,240
我知道
I know.

399
00:12:52,680 --> 00:12:55,720
我刚刚被你爸说的话吓到了
You know, you scared me earlier with what your dad said.

400
00:12:55,720 --> 00:12:56,620
怎么了
W-what?

401
00:12:56,620 --> 00:12:58,440
就是关于山火
Well, just about the fire, you know...

402
00:12:58,960 --> 00:13:00,780
预示着我们不该结婚的事
being a sign we shouldn't get married.

403
00:13:00,780 --> 00:13:02,782
有点末日预言的感觉
It was kind of apocalypticy.

404
00:13:02,782 --> 00:13:04,480
-才不是呢 -然后天就黑了
- No. - Then the sky turned dark.

405
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:05,560
没错 因为有山火
Yeah, because of the fire.

406
00:13:05,780 --> 00:13:06,860
然后发了"洪水"
Well, and then we had a flood.

407
00:13:06,920 --> 00:13:08,180
你懂的 萨尔的羊水破了
You know, Sal -- sploosh.

408
00:13:08,380 --> 00:13:10,680
我觉得你脑洞开得有点大
I think you're stretching just a little bit.

409
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:12,960
因为我们花钱订了房间
Because we paid for this room!

410
00:13:12,980 --> 00:13:15,320
卢卡斯夫妇 我们只要20分钟
Mr. and Mrs. Lucas, we just need 20 minutes!

411
00:13:15,420 --> 00:13:16,360
把音乐停下
Cut the boy soprano.

412
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:18,380
不行 让这些人都出去
No, we need these people out of here!

413
00:13:18,620 --> 00:13:20,520
你还是想逃婚对不对
I can see you want to run again, don't you?

414
00:13:20,700 --> 00:13:21,680
追随你的心
Follow your heart.

415
00:13:21,680 --> 00:13:24,020
各就各位 预备 过自己的生活去吧
On your mark, get set, live, baby!

416
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:25,380
你不需要这个
You don't need that!

417
00:13:25,540 --> 00:13:27,540
你不觉得这又是一个上帝的旨意吗
You don't see this as another biblical sign?

418
00:13:27,540 --> 00:13:29,260
一大群卢卡斯们
A swarm of "Lucases."

419
00:13:29,260 --> 00:13:30,400
各位 安排有点小变动
Slight change, everyone!

420
00:13:30,880 --> 00:13:31,520
不用担心
Don't worry!

421
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:33,100
我们有第三套备用方案
There's always a plan "C"!

422
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:36,660
天呐 到处都是蝴蝶
Oh! They're everywhere!

423
00:13:36,980 --> 00:13:38,720
你们都是什么毛病啊
What is wrong with you people?

424
00:13:38,740 --> 00:13:40,380
别去动盒子了
Leave the box alone!

425
00:13:41,034 --> 00:13:42,700
要是把那个拿进来
Oh, if that thing is coming in,

426
00:13:42,700 --> 00:13:44,660
更多宾客就得站到草坪上去了
we need to put a few more people on the lawn.

427
00:13:45,624 --> 00:13:46,328
这个地方还算舒适吧
Okay, this place is cozy, right?

428
00:13:46,338 --> 00:13:47,890
没错 没错 没错
Yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

429
00:13:47,890 --> 00:13:50,030
这里很好 一切都会好的
It's fine. It's -- oh, it's going to be fine.

430
00:13:50,030 --> 00:13:50,580
就是 就是 就是
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

431
00:13:50,580 --> 00:13:52,100
不过我们可能需要
Although we may need to

432
00:13:52,100 --> 00:13:53,840
让一部分宾客坐到楼上
sit some of the overflow guests upstairs.

433
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:56,180
楼上不是我们的
Oh, we don't -- we don't own the upstairs.

434
00:13:56,180 --> 00:13:56,560
是吗
Really?

435
00:13:57,060 --> 00:13:58,960
我一直以为你家还有更好的地方
I always assumed there was a nicer part

436
00:13:58,960 --> 00:14:00,980
没让我看过
you weren't showing me.

437
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:03,060
确保他们把账单都付清
Make sure their checks have cleared.

438
00:14:06,220 --> 00:14:08,240
再找一个餐饮服务商来
Just get another caterer here

439
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:10,760
不然这些人就只能喝蝴蝶汤了
or these people will be eating butterfly bisque!

440
00:14:10,900 --> 00:14:12,100
我在尝试冷静下来
Okay, I'm trying to remain calm,

441
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:14,420
可是你不觉得这又是一个凶兆吗
but you realize that's another sign of the apocalypse, right?

442
00:14:14,420 --> 00:14:15,204
饥荒吗
Famine?

443
00:14:15,204 --> 00:14:16,763
他听起来跟斯蒂芬和斯特凡
He sounds as bad as Steven, Stefan,

444
00:14:16,763 --> 00:14:17,460
和朗吉娜一样糟
and Longines.

445
00:14:17,460 --> 00:14:18,380
你是想说我们有四个
Oh, so what you're saying

446
00:14:18,380 --> 00:14:19,857
嘶哑的男人[骑士]吗
is we have four hoarse men?

447
00:14:20,160 --> 00:14:21,460
别皱着眉头了
Stop with the frowning.

448
00:14:21,520 --> 00:14:22,980
今天要为你们的儿子保持笑容
Today, you smile for your son.

449
00:14:23,040 --> 00:14:24,560
明天你们想做什么都可以
Tomorrow, you can do whatever you want.

450
00:14:24,780 --> 00:14:27,300
明天我大概就搬出去了
Tomorrow, I might just move out.

451
00:14:27,966 --> 00:14:30,430
现在我感觉到笑意了
Oh, now I feel a smile coming on.

452
00:14:31,460 --> 00:14:33,460
天啊 你在给安迪发短信吗
Oh, my god. You're texting Andy now?

453
00:14:33,520 --> 00:14:36,080
我只是告诉他愿意的话可以来玩
I'm just letting him know he can hang out here if he wants.

454
00:14:36,340 --> 00:14:38,940
海莉 我希望你知道自己在干什么
Haley, I hope you know what you're doing.

455
00:14:39,060 --> 00:14:40,080
我什么也没做
I'm not doing anything.

456
00:14:40,960 --> 00:14:43,580
你要是真的喜欢他是一回事
I mean, it's one thing if you're actually into him,

457
00:14:43,580 --> 00:14:45,520
可如果你只是想
but if you're just playing around with him

458
00:14:45,520 --> 00:14:46,420
跟他玩玩
for the fun of it...

459
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:49,540
对于安迪这种单纯善良的人来说
Here's the thing about nice, quiet dorks like Andy.

460
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:52,020
我们需要花比你多得多的时间
You get over us much faster than

461
00:14:52,020 --> 00:14:52,900
放下一段感情
we get over you.

462
00:14:56,020 --> 00:14:58,600
不好意思 真对不起
Hi. Sorry. So sorry.

463
00:14:58,600 --> 00:14:59,880
不好意思 里面是我老公
Excuse me. It's my husband.

464
00:14:59,880 --> 00:15:01,580
人们说最好的婚姻
"They say the best marriages" --

465
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:05,260
我不是要催你
I don't mean to rush you,

466
00:15:05,280 --> 00:15:07,200
可是外面已经排了有80多个人了
but there's like 80 people waiting to get in here.

467
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:08,500
不不不 你来了正好
No, no, no. I'm so glad you're here.

468
00:15:08,500 --> 00:15:09,840
我刚想到了一个新的魔术
I just worked up a new magic trick.

469
00:15:09,980 --> 00:15:12,900
我先说 "人们说最好的婚姻
I start by saying, "They say the best marriages

470
00:15:12,900 --> 00:15:15,780
需要一点点魔力"
contain just a little bit of magic."

471
00:15:15,780 --> 00:15:18,600
而袖子里装着我从莉莉柜子里找到的
Then in my sleeves, I've rigged two confetti poppers

472
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:20,000
两管彩色纸屑
that I found in Lily's closet.

473
00:15:20,120 --> 00:15:23,360
到时我一抬手
So when I raise my arms...

474
00:15:24,161 --> 00:15:25,906
真的吗 你怎么不说"别这么做"
Really? You're not gonna say, "Don't do that"?

475
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,680
不 我不觉得这是个好主意
No, I mean, I don't think you need the magic trick,

476
00:15:27,680 --> 00:15:29,320
可是如果你要做 效果一定会很好
but if you do it, I'm sure you'll be great.

477
00:15:30,800 --> 00:15:31,460
亲爱的
Oh, honey.

478
00:15:31,860 --> 00:15:34,020
天啊 别动我来 亲爱的 不
Oh, god, let me get that. Honey! No!

479
00:15:34,120 --> 00:15:35,320
亲爱的 不 小心
Honey, no! Hey!

480
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:36,699
菲尔 不
Phil! Oh, no!

481
00:15:36,699 --> 00:15:38,244
不要 水开了 水开了
No, no, water's on! Water's on!

482
00:15:38,244 --> 00:15:39,409
不 你
No! You --

483
00:15:40,235 --> 00:15:41,343
-请稍等 -请稍等
-Just a minute. - Just a minute.

484
00:15:45,160 --> 00:15:46,800
-你好 安迪 -你好
-Hey Andy. - Hey.

485
00:15:47,220 --> 00:15:48,380
婚礼开始了吗
Has the wedding started yet?

486
00:15:48,700 --> 00:15:50,120
开始好几次了
Oh, yeah, lots of times.

487
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:52,483
-怎么了 -没什么
-What's up? - Oh, nothing.

488
00:15:52,560 --> 00:15:55,640
你之前说的关于我值得更好的人
Hey, that thing you said before about me deserving better,

489
00:15:55,800 --> 00:15:57,940
你就那么一说 对吧
you just meant, like, in general, right?

490
00:15:58,000 --> 00:16:00,220
你不是在说某个特定的人对吧
You weren't thinking of anyone in particular?

491
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:05,420
对 不 我的意思是你值得拥有幸福
Yeah, no, I-I just meant you deserve to be happy.

492
00:16:05,420 --> 00:16:06,760
如果这个女孩能让你幸福 再好不过
And if it's this girl, great.

493
00:16:06,820 --> 00:16:07,900
如果不是她 那也很好
If not, great.

494
00:16:07,900 --> 00:16:10,140
有些时候 最难的事
Um, sometimes the hardest part

495
00:16:10,140 --> 00:16:11,440
是弄清楚自己想要什么
is just figuring out what you want.

496
00:16:12,320 --> 00:16:13,220
我也是这么想的
Yeah, that's what I thought.

497
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:15,260
玩得开心
Well, enjoy the wedding.

498
00:16:15,800 --> 00:16:16,980
谢谢 一路平安
Thanks. Have a nice trip.

499
00:16:17,680 --> 00:16:20,140
再见
Yeah. I'll see you.

500
00:16:25,920 --> 00:16:27,380
真高兴我们做到了
I'm so glad we did this.

501
00:16:27,380 --> 00:16:28,673
那当然 我们这么认真
I know. Who were we kidding?

502
00:16:28,673 --> 00:16:29,939
必须能做到
It was so gonna happen.

503
00:16:30,460 --> 00:16:32,040
实在太搞笑了
I can't get enough of this.

504
00:16:33,800 --> 00:16:36,500
不 米奇没事 不过还在生我的气
No, Mitch is fine. Still mad at me, though.

505
00:16:37,218 --> 00:16:39,297
你也知道他有时是多么敏感易怒 迪迪
You know how touchy he can be, Dede.

506
00:16:39,740 --> 00:16:41,620
你还记得在他第一次参加完滑冰比赛后
Remember when we tried to cheer him up

507
00:16:41,620 --> 00:16:43,420
我们试图哄他开心的事吗
after his first ice-skating competition?

508
00:16:44,920 --> 00:16:47,840
我们怎么知道第三名是好事啊
How were we supposed to know third place is a good thing?

509
00:16:48,540 --> 00:16:50,140
还记得他穿着旱冰鞋
Remember he tromped off

510
00:16:50,140 --> 00:16:51,780
在泥地里乱踩的场景吗
across that muddy field in his skates?

511
00:16:51,910 --> 00:16:53,734
他像个猛犸象一样陷了下去
He sunk like a woolly mammoth.

512
00:16:54,274 --> 00:16:56,520
对了迪迪 如果你国庆节时有空的话
Hey, Dede, if you're around the fourth of July,

513
00:16:56,520 --> 00:16:58,280
就过来观看一下婚礼录像吧
you should come by and watch the wedding video.

514
00:17:00,800 --> 00:17:02,340
不 我们八月会出城
No, we're out of town in August.

515
00:17:03,420 --> 00:17:05,500
好吧 很快的 好的
All right. Well, soon. Okay.

516
00:17:06,181 --> 00:17:08,245
迪迪 我好像没有你的新...
Oh, Dede, I don't think I have your new --

517
00:17:17,120 --> 00:17:19,140
好了 见证奇迹的时刻到了
Okay, it's magic time, everyone!

518
00:17:19,340 --> 00:17:23,100
菲尔 请在庄严的拱门下就位
Phil, please take your place beneath our majestic arch.

519
00:17:23,980 --> 00:17:24,600
开始演奏吧
Cue the quartet.

520
00:17:25,460 --> 00:17:26,240
还有一个人去哪儿了
Where's the other one?

521
00:17:26,273 --> 00:17:28,873
他跟那个把货车开翻了的餐饮承办员跑了
He rode with the caterer who flipped his truck.

522
00:17:28,940 --> 00:17:31,020
为什么大家都摊上了好事 就我没有呢
Why do good things happen to everyone but me?

523
00:17:31,460 --> 00:17:32,560
赶快派上花童吧
Let's send the flower girl

524
00:17:32,560 --> 00:17:34,100
再等她就长成花季少女了
before she's a flower teenager.

525
00:17:36,860 --> 00:17:38,440
好悲伤
Oh, so sad.

526
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:39,060
抱歉
Sorry.

527
00:17:40,242 --> 00:17:43,152
-搞毛 -行了 搞得像问题出在我身上一样
- What is ... - Yeah. Like I'm the problem.

528
00:17:43,520 --> 00:17:44,440
你爸在这儿吗
Is your dad here?

529
00:17:44,560 --> 00:17:46,500
是的 他应该很快就...
Yeah, he should be right --

530
00:17:46,889 --> 00:17:47,360
天啊
Oh -- oh, my god.

531
00:17:47,360 --> 00:17:48,720
他在外面人行道上打电话呢
He's out on the sidewalk on the phone.

532
00:17:49,180 --> 00:17:50,380
你需要我去叫他吗
Do you want me to go get him?

533
00:17:50,440 --> 00:17:51,840
不 不想 我们就...算了
No, no, I don't. Let's just -- come on.

534
00:17:51,860 --> 00:17:52,620
我们直接开始吧
Let's just do this.

535
00:17:54,940 --> 00:17:55,300
米奇尔
Mitchell.

536
00:17:56,560 --> 00:17:58,340
你真的想就这样完成婚礼吗
Is this really how you want to get married?

537
00:17:58,420 --> 00:17:59,260
是不理想
Well, it's not ideal.

538
00:17:59,260 --> 00:18:01,061
不行 人们都没有米可抛洒
No, people don't have any rice to throw

539
00:18:01,061 --> 00:18:03,220
因为他们都饿得吃生米了
because they're chewing it raw out of starvation.

540
00:18:03,220 --> 00:18:05,220
一半的宾客在外面的草坪上
Half of our guests are on the lawn and...

541
00:18:06,340 --> 00:18:06,940
洒水车来了
There go the sprinklers.

542
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:09,220
好吧 我们宣布"婚礼死亡"算了吧
Okay, let's just call time of death on this.

543
00:18:09,372 --> 00:18:10,632
好吧
All right, yeah.

544
00:18:10,752 --> 00:18:13,131
那个 大家 非常感谢你们
Hey, everybody, um, thank you so much

545
00:18:13,131 --> 00:18:15,380
今天承受这么多的折腾
for, uh, for dealing with all this today.

546
00:18:15,380 --> 00:18:16,260
那对我们意义重大
It means a lot to us.

547
00:18:16,260 --> 00:18:17,580
但不幸的是 这场婚礼实在...
But unfortunately, this is not gon--

548
00:18:17,580 --> 00:18:18,820
停 你不能这么做
Stop. You can't do this.

549
00:18:19,060 --> 00:18:19,800
我已经赶在你前面停止了
I'm way ahead of you, dad,

550
00:18:19,800 --> 00:18:20,820
谢谢你能赏光过来
and thank you for stopping by.

551
00:18:20,840 --> 00:18:23,520
我的意思是 你不能像这样草草就结婚
What I mean is, you can't get married like this.

552
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:25,320
你们两个值得拥有一场
You two deserve the kind of wedding

553
00:18:25,320 --> 00:18:26,760
你们在过去的9个月中
you've been talking about nonstop

554
00:18:26,760 --> 00:18:27,960
不停挂在嘴边的梦幻婚礼
for the last nine months.

555
00:18:28,140 --> 00:18:28,760
你这是什么意思
What do you mean?

556
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:30,280
你们一有机会就会谈论婚礼
You bring it up every chance that you get.

557
00:18:30,280 --> 00:18:31,740
我知道"不停"二字是什么意思
I know what nonstop means!

558
00:18:31,820 --> 00:18:32,960
相信我 好吗
Trust me, okay?

559
00:18:34,820 --> 00:18:36,640
我们都站在这儿干嘛啊
Now, what are we all standing around for?

560
00:18:37,240 --> 00:18:38,940
我儿子今天要结婚了
My son's getting married today.

561
00:18:39,580 --> 00:18:40,700
恭喜 杰
All right, Jay.

562
00:18:40,700 --> 00:18:42,360
那正是这所高尔夫俱乐部需要的
It's what this golf club needs.

563
00:18:42,600 --> 00:18:43,340
改变一下旧风貌
Shake it up a little.

564
00:18:43,500 --> 00:18:44,120
上吧 小宝贝
Go on, dear.

565
00:18:44,240 --> 00:18:45,980
爸爸们能结几次婚啊
How often do your fathers get married?

566
00:18:46,280 --> 00:18:49,420
目前已经结了一次 两次
So far, one, two...

567
00:18:49,420 --> 00:18:50,780
你赶紧给我滚出吧
Why am I still seeing you?

568
00:18:53,890 --> 00:18:54,460
你可以坐下了 老爸
You can take your seat, dad.

569
00:18:54,460 --> 00:18:55,160
我们要开始了
We're about to start.

570
00:18:55,520 --> 00:18:57,740
我觉得我们父子俩要小走一段
Actually, I thought you and I would take a little walk.

571
00:19:01,120 --> 00:19:03,640
我感觉一切仿如昨日
I remember it like it was yesterday --

572
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:06,440
米奇尔被从医院抱回的那天
The day that Mitchell came home from the hospital

573
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:09,820
身上裹着土的掉渣的白色尿布
in a very unfashionable white diaper

574
00:19:09,820 --> 00:19:13,800
头上是三缕杂乱分布的头发
with three strands of scraggly raggedy andy hair.

575
00:19:14,260 --> 00:19:15,980
如果他要牵儿子走红毯 那我也要
If he's doing it, I'm doing it.

576
00:19:16,240 --> 00:19:17,280
你一起来吗 巴布
You coming, Barb?

577
00:19:18,020 --> 00:19:19,410
你可真是老甜心
You old sweet talker.

578
00:19:19,980 --> 00:19:21,200
等等我
Wait for me!

579
00:19:23,140 --> 00:19:24,580
我们从此变得不可分离
We were inseparable.

580
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:27,260
我是他的大姐
I was his big sister,

581
00:19:27,740 --> 00:19:31,340
也是他的大哥 他的死对头
his big brother, his nemesis,

582
00:19:31,600 --> 00:19:33,960
他的保护人 也是他最亲密的朋友
his protector, his best friend.

583
00:19:35,760 --> 00:19:37,500
我的他的第一个搭档
I was his first partner.

584
00:19:37,740 --> 00:19:40,820
我享受当中的每一分每一秒
And I loved every minute of it.

585
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:43,940
感谢大家参与这一盛大的喜事
Thank you all for being here on this happy occasion.

586
00:19:45,240 --> 00:19:49,320
人们常说最好的婚姻都蕴含着一丝魔力
They say the best marriages contain just a little bit of magic.

587
00:19:51,280 --> 00:19:52,200
相信我
Believe me.

588
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:53,980
我深有感触
I know.

589
00:19:57,220 --> 00:20:00,060
我们相聚在此 参加一对璧人的婚礼
We're gathered here today to join two amazing people.

590
00:20:00,540 --> 00:20:02,240
自然 在由谁来取代我这件事上
So naturally, I was a little picky

591
00:20:02,240 --> 00:20:05,220
我会表现得有一点吹毛求疵
when it came to who was going to be replacing me,

592
00:20:05,420 --> 00:20:06,940
然后我认识了这个叫小卡的人
And then I met this Cam.

593
00:20:07,840 --> 00:20:11,140
当然 他很温暖 风趣 有爱
And sure, he was warm and funny and loving.

594
00:20:14,940 --> 00:20:17,160
卡梅隆 你愿意让米奇尔成为你的丈夫吗
Cameron, do you take Mitchell to be your husband?

595
00:20:17,320 --> 00:20:17,900
我愿意
I do.

596
00:20:18,620 --> 00:20:21,520
卡梅隆 请你为米奇尔戴上戒指
Cameron, would you please place this ring on Mitchell's finger?

597
00:20:23,980 --> 00:20:26,640
米奇尔 你愿意让卡梅隆成为你的丈夫吗
Mitchell, do you take Cameron to be your husband?

598
00:20:27,700 --> 00:20:28,520
我愿意
I do.

599
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:32,620
那么凭借加州政府授予我的权力
Then by the powers vested in me by the state of California,

600
00:20:32,680 --> 00:20:35,560
我宣布你们结为终身配偶
I am privileged to pronounce you spouses for life.

601
00:20:35,560 --> 00:20:37,860
你们可以行"夫夫吻"了
You may now kiss your husband.

602
00:20:44,920 --> 00:20:46,160
我也曾疑惑
I wondered,

603
00:20:46,440 --> 00:20:47,070
"他真的是我期望
"Was he really

604
00:20:47,640 --> 00:20:49,520
与我弟弟幸福相伴的那个人吗
everything I wanted for my brother?

605
00:20:50,340 --> 00:20:53,100
他真的是最棒的那个人吗"
Was he really the best person?"

606
00:20:53,100 --> 00:20:56,520
不 我才是"伴人"
No, I'm the best person.

607
00:20:59,440 --> 00:21:02,760
现在我想举起杯子
And now I am very pleased to raise a glass

608
00:21:02,760 --> 00:21:04,760
第一次隆重地向大家介绍
And introduce for the first time ever --

609
00:21:04,760 --> 00:21:06,860
尽管这已经是第4次尝试了
on our fourth try --

610
00:21:07,380 --> 00:21:09,560
天造地设的一对夫夫 米奇和小卡
great husbands, Mitch and Cam.

611
00:21:10,175 --> 00:21:11,355
恭喜
Yes!

612
00:21:25,480 --> 00:21:26,720
我看到了
I saw that.

613
00:21:27,180 --> 00:21:27,280
什么啊
What?

614
00:21:27,880 --> 00:21:29,160
你看我老姐的眼神
The way you look at my sister.

615
00:21:29,560 --> 00:21:30,720
你老是这么色眯眯的
You do it all the time, you know.

616
00:21:30,780 --> 00:21:31,440
我才没有呢
I do not.

617
00:21:31,680 --> 00:21:33,040
别当着我的面这样 好吗
Just not in front of me, okay?

618
00:21:34,033 --> 00:21:36,520
你两位老爸去度蜜月了 有跟你联系吗
So, have you heard from your dads on their honeymoon?

619
00:21:36,520 --> 00:21:37,760
你一定很想他们吧
You must really miss them, don't you?

620
00:21:38,080 --> 00:21:39,840
抱歉 我有点小题大做了
Sorry. I was being dramatic.

621
00:21:39,960 --> 00:21:41,020
怎么会 你说得很对
No, you were right.

622
00:21:41,140 --> 00:21:42,080
你会自厌自弃的
You'll hate yourself.

623
00:21:42,380 --> 00:21:43,060
又来了
Right again.

624
00:21:43,360 --> 00:21:45,180
就像他们根本没离开一样
It's like they never left.
